{"synopsis":"Dewa Pedang, Ahn Su-ho. Anehnya, pemain pendekar pedang terhebat umat manusia adalah seorang pemburu pegawai negeri yang berafiliasi dengan Asosiasi Pemburu Korea. Su-ho memilih jalur pegawai negeri semata-mata untuk mengakhiri gerbang. Mungkin itu sebabnya? Ketika salah satu gerbang tingkat bencana, yang disebut gerbang terakhir, diserang, dalam kejadian yang ironis, dia dikhianati oleh rekan-rekannya. “Akan lebih baik jika dia bergabung dengan kami sejak awal. Pegawai negeri sangat keras kepala.” Alasan rekan-rekannya mengkhianatinya? Karena jika gerbang ditutup, pengaruh mereka akan hilang. Apakah ini akhirnya? Saat kesadaran Su-ho mulai memudar, \\[Me-reboot sistem pemain Ahn Su- ho.] Sistem memberi Su-ho satu kesempatan lagi untuk kembali ke masa lalu dan mengatur segalanya dengan benar.","alternative_title":"Return of the Sword God-Rank Civil Servant 검신급 공무원의 회귀","author":"Gaetgangu, Zary","artist":"Studio Neulbom","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"02942f23-daf7-4c34-818e-db7d61b3cbef","number":"95","chapter":"95","title":"","date":"2026-06-12","released":"2026-06-12"},{"chapter_id":"b49ee6db-e634-4be0-a8ab-2dc870acbad4","number":"94","chapter":"94","title":"","date":"2026-06-05","released":"2026-06-05"},{"chapter_id":"7d98b86e-b9df-4114-a0ed-6138e228b7a3","number":"93","chapter":"93","title":"","date":"2026-05-30","released":"2026-05-30"},{"chapter_id":"c3e62a6c-0d8d-4a91-960c-e5c9278e4bfb","number":"92","chapter":"92","title":"","date":"2026-05-23","released":"2026-05-23"},{"chapter_id":"d1778a70-96eb-460f-ab42-8aff20e533e9","number":"91","chapter":"91","title":"","date":"2026-05-15","released":"2026-05-15"},{"chapter_id":"145c2c57-e44b-4f39-a932-4c7e336fc1e2","number":"90","chapter":"90","title":"","date":"2026-05-09","released":"2026-05-09"},{"chapter_id":"d803dd5d-f865-4b25-a9d6-470c0e41dcfc","number":"89","chapter":"89","title":"","date":"2026-05-03","released":"2026-05-03"},{"chapter_id":"45fcf9de-eb7e-41a0-82ee-c4b0568eaf01","number":"88","chapte